didn't sound very happy.

238
00:12:53.898 --> 00:12:54.899
- You got kids?

239
00:12:54.941 --> 00:12:57.818
- I do not have kids, no.

240
00:12:57.860 --> 00:13:00.530
- Then you don't know
how much parents hate

241
00:13:00.572 --> 00:13:01.531
