243
00:13:04.992 --> 00:13:06.869
But I do have parents.

244
00:13:06.911 --> 00:13:09.581
As frustrating as they can be,
the good ones always love ya.

245
00:13:09.623 --> 00:13:11.165
That's a fact.

246
00:13:11.207 --> 00:13:12.667
